{"text": "Requena Immigration Law, PLLC  -  6200 Savoy Dr., Ste. 410, Houston, TX 77036  -  (713) 555-0162\nLISTA DE DOCUMENTOS / DOCUMENT CHECKLIST            Expediente / File: RIL-24-0933\nPreparado por / Prepared by: Mirna Carbajal, paralegal        Fecha: 5 de noviembre de 2025\n\nCLIENTE / CLIENT:   ZELAYA MURILLO, Yorleny Patricia     A# A209 771 448\n   Nacida / born 23/08/1991 en San Pedro Sula, Honduras\nPETICIONARIO / PETITIONER:   Brandon Keith Sattler (esposo, ciudadano / U.S. citizen), born 02/14/1988, Beaumont, Texas\nHIJO / CHILD:   Dariel Zelaya, 9 años, A# A209 771 449\n\nCASOS / CASES PENDING\n  I-130 (esposa)   receipt IOE0931447182   filed 03/11/2025\n  I-130 (hijastro) receipt IOE0931447190\n  I-601A provisional waiver - NOT yet filed. Needed because she entered without inspection near Hidalgo in June 2016.\n  TPS: registered since 2018, currently valid. EAD card no. SRC2190441877, vence / expires 07/05/2026.\n\nLO QUE YA TENEMOS / WHAT WE HAVE                                          OK\n  [x] Pasaporte hondureño de Yorleny, no. F418820\n  [x] Acta de matrimonio, Harris County, 19 de octubre de 2024\n  [x] Partida de nacimiento de Dariel con traducción\n  [x] Brandon's birth certificate and 2022-2024 tax transcripts (I-864). Income $54,300. SSN 678-33-3479.\n\nLO QUE FALTA / STILL MISSING                                              Para cuándo\n  [ ] Examen médico I-693 con la Clínica Buen Samaritano - cita martes 18 de noviembre, 8:30. Costo $380 por persona, efectivo.\n      Nota: en 2019 le salió positiva la prueba de tuberculina; radiografía normal. Traer la radiografía.\n  [ ] Récord policial. Yorleny says she was arrested in 2019 for driving without a license; case dismissed (Fort Bend County, no. 19-CCR-204418). We need the certified disposition.\n  [ ] Carta de dificultad extrema (hardship) from Brandon: mention that he has epilepsy and cannot drive, and that Yorleny takes him to work.\n  [ ] Proof Dariel is in school: he is in fourth grade at Sutton Elementary.\n  [ ] 2 fotos tipo pasaporte c/u\n\nHONORARIOS / FEES\n  Filing fees I-601A $795 + biometrics. Honorarios del abogado $3,500.00; pagado $1,200 el 10/02; saldo $2,300 en pagos de $250 cada quincena.\n\nCONTACTO\n  Yorleny cel. 832-555-0147 (WhatsApp; no dejar mensaje de voz, comparte el teléfono con su cuñada)\n  Dirección: 9100 Bissonnet St., Apt. 2207, Houston, TX 77074\n  Brandon: bsattler88@gulfmail.example, trabajo 281.555.0190\n\nRevisado por / Reviewed: Lic. Osvaldo Requena (Texas Bar No. 24091877)   MC", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "365 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Mirna Carbajal", "Yorleny Patricia", "Brandon Keith Sattler", "Dariel Zelaya", "Yorleny", "Brandon"], "companies": ["Requena Immigration Law", "Clínica Buen Samaritano", "Harris County", "Fort Bend County", "Sutton Elementary", "gulfmail"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Houston", "Beaumont", "San Pedro Sula", "Bissonnet St."], "health": ["epilepsy", "tuberculina", "radiografía normal"], "sensitive": ["immigration", "criminal history"], "names": ["Yorleny", "Brandon", "Dariel", "Osvaldo"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.10000000149011612, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 29, "text": "Requena Immigration Law, PLLC", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Requena Immigration Law, PLLC"}, {"start": 34, "end": 58, "text": "6200 Savoy Dr., Ste. 410", "kind": "street", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "6200 Savoy Dr., Ste. 410"}, {"start": 60, "end": 67, "text": "Houston", "kind": "pla